.TH CLOG_GET_FORMAT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
clog_get_format \- return the current output format
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/clogger.h>

clog_format_t clog_get_format(clog logger);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the output format that the shared backing store uses at the
moment of the call.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
logger  Logger handle.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
CLOG_FMT_LOGFMT, CLOG_FMT_JSON, or CLOG_FMT_SYSLOG.
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Thread-safe, because the mutex of the shared backing store protects the
call.
Asserts when logger is CLOG_INVALID, stale or already closed.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR clog_set_format (3),
.BR clog_set_facility (3)
